# ============================================================
# HireFlo — Trivy vulnerability exceptions
# ============================================================
#
# This file documents intentional exceptions to the Trivy scan policy.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, with a comment explaining the exception.
#
# Policy:
#   CRITICAL vulnerabilities   → always fail CI (no exceptions)
#   HIGH with a fix available  → always fail CI (no exceptions)
#   HIGH with no fix available → can be excepted here with justification
#   MEDIUM / LOW               → reported only, never fail CI
#
# When adding an exception:
#   1. State the CVE
#   2. State why it does not affect HireFlo
#   3. Set a review date (re-evaluate on next dependency update)
#
# Example:
#   # CVE-2024-XXXXX | libX | Not exploitable — we never call the affected API
#   # Review: 2026-04-01
#   CVE-2024-XXXXX
#
# ============================================================

# No exceptions at this time.
